{
    "title": "Manticore - The Spire",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_outlaws) == 2",
    "variables": [
        {
            "name": "atrelay",
            "value": "0"
        }
    ],
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 9 - The Spire",
                "zh": "第九章 - 尖塔"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The upload takes ninety seconds. You'll need to hold a position near the Spire while it runs. Their whole security fleet will come at you.",
                        "zh": "上传需要九十秒。传输期间你得守在尖塔附近的一个位置。他们的整支安保舰队都会冲你来。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Ines Marlowe",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Once the board sees the ledger, Crane loses his protection. He'll run. Don't let him.",
                        "zh": "董事会一看到账本，克莱恩就失去了保护伞。他会逃跑。别让他跑了。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Ninety seconds, ace. The longest of your life. Make them count.",
                        "zh": "九十秒，王牌。你这辈子最长的九十秒。好好用。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "spire_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fly to Paragon Spire.",
                "zh": "飞往典范尖塔。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "waypoint",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire",
            "at": "0 2000 22000"
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire",
            "text": {
                "en": "Reach the relay point near the Spire.",
                "zh": "抵达尖塔附近的中继点。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "distance(player, 0, 2000, 22000) >= 0"
        },
        {
            "type": "on",
            "trigger": "near",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire",
            "at": "0 2000 22000",
            "radius": 3000,
            "steps": [
                {
                    "type": "set",
                    "variable": "atrelay",
                    "value": "1"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "atrelay > 0"
        },
        {
            "type": "waypoint",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire",
            "at": ""
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Saya",
            "text": {
                "en": "In position. Starting the upload... now. Keep them off you!",
                "zh": "就位了。开始上传……就是现在。别让他们靠近你！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "timer",
            "seconds": 90,
            "label": {
                "en": "Upload",
                "zh": "上传"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 3,
            "behaviour": "enemy",
            "name": "Spire Guard"
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 30
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 28,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 2,
            "behaviour": "enemy",
            "name": "Spire Guard"
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 30
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 3,
            "behaviour": "enemy",
            "name": "Spire Guard"
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 30
        },
        {
            "type": "timer",
            "stop": true
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Saya",
            "text": {
                "en": "Upload complete! It's on every screen in the Spire. The board just voted. Crane is out!",
                "zh": "上传完成！尖塔里的每一块屏幕上都是它。董事会刚刚投票了，克莱恩完了！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Halvard Crane",
            "text": {
                "en": "You think a vote stops me? I built this sector. If I can't own it, I'll burn it.",
                "zh": "你以为一次投票就能阻止我？这个星区是我建起来的。我得不到它，就烧了它。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 28,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 2,
            "behaviour": "enemy",
            "name": "Crane Bodyguard"
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Halvard Crane",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 28,
                    "count": 1,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Stop Halvard Crane.",
                "zh": "拦下哈尔瓦德·克莱恩。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire",
            "text": {
                "en": "Clear the rest of Crane's ships.",
                "zh": "清除克莱恩剩下的飞船。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "alive(Crane Bodyguard) == 0 and alive(Spire Guard) == 0"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:spire",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Ines Marlowe",
            "text": {
                "en": "Crane's ship is down. Paragon's board is calling it a security accident. The ledger goes to the sector courts tomorrow.",
                "zh": "克莱恩的飞船被击落了。典范董事会称之为一次安全事故。账本明天就会提交星区法院。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 30000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Crane stopped",
                "zh": "克莱恩被拦下"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "crane_down"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "ACT II COMPLETE",
                "zh": "第二幕 完成"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "The ledger is public.",
                "zh": "账本已经公开。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Paragon cancelled the bounty, apologised in very small print, and offered us a contract. I told them we'd think about it.",
                        "zh": "典范取消了悬赏，用很小的字道了歉，还给了我们一份合同。我说我们会考虑的。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "One more thing in Crane's files. The pirates weren't his only investment. He was paying someone to dig into the Shattering itself. Coordinates beyond Valtor.",
                        "zh": "克莱恩的文件里还有一件事。海盗并不是他唯一的投资。他还在付钱给人调查“碎裂”事件本身。坐标在瓦尔托之外。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "So the man who built a business on fear wanted to know what broke the frontier in the first place. That's a question worth an answer.",
                        "zh": "一个靠恐惧做生意的人，竟然想知道最初是什么让边境破碎的。这个问题值得找个答案。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Rest up, ace. When we find out what Crane was looking for, the Manticore goes after it.",
                        "zh": "好好休息，王牌。等我们查清克莱恩在找什么，蝎尾狮号就会去追。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 20000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Act II complete",
                "zh": "第二幕 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
